TDLua — third-party notices
===========================

TDLua is distributed under the BSD-3-Clause license; see LICENSE.

Binaries of the module embed or link the components below. This file lists
them so that a binary package carries the same attribution as the source
tree. It is installed next to the licenses in
<prefix>/share/licenses/tdlua/.

TDLib 1.8.68 — Boost Software License 1.0
-----------------------------------------
Source: https://github.com/tdlib/td
Pinned submodule commit: c15d3f5a5de6e3ba5839822c451152e5e18bb700
License text: legal/TDLib-LICENSE_1_0.txt
SHA-256 of that file at the pinned commit:
  c9bff75738922193e67fa726fa225535870d2aa1059f91452c411736284ad566

TDLib is linked into the module for both backends: statically with
TDLUA_BUNDLED_TDLIB=OFF plus a static Td package, and statically from the
bundled submodule with TDLUA_BUNDLED_TDLIB=ON. The Boost license text is
shipped in every install regardless of how TDLib was obtained, because the
build no longer depends on the submodule being checked out to find it.

