Runtime dependencies not redistributed
--------------------------------------
The module loads these from the host system and they are not bundled:

  Lua 5.1-5.5 / LuaJIT   MIT
  OpenSSL 3              Apache-2.0
  zlib                   zlib
  libstdc++ / libc++     GPL-3.0-or-later WITH GCC-exception-3.1 / Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
  libm, libgcc_s, libc   glibc LGPL-2.1-or-later

Windows packages bundle the non-system DLLs (OpenSSL, zlib) next to the
module; their license texts are added to the package when it is produced.
